            </button>
          </h2>
          <ul
            id="footer-resources"
            data-panel="resources"
            aria-hidden="true"
            hidden
            class="space-y-3 text-sm text-dark-300"
          >
            <li>
              <a
                class="transition-colors hover:text-[#e9531c]"
                href="/beneficios">Beneficios</a
